      ],
      "text": "The run command accepts optional flags overriding config defaults, including --model (default gpt-3.5-turbo), --temperature (0.2), --request-timeout (60), --base-url, --target-repo-path, --hierarchy-path, --markdown-docs-path, --ignore-list, --language (default Chinese), and --log-level."
